; START PANEL (M1b): window WX = 87 (screen cols 10-19), WY = 0, slides in WX 167 -> 87 in
; 8 f (10 px/f) and out the same way. Window map col = screen col - 10. A drawer: left
; border only, top/bottom lines run to the screen edge. Entries rows 1-8 (1-row pitch,
; checked: no descender touches a letter below), cursor col 11, text cols 12-19.
; 'Mapa' is M2: in M1 the list has 7 entries and rows shift up (row = 1 + index).
; Stats rows 10-15: HUD sprites move in as labels (heart = PV, bowl = saciedad).
tilesets: ui font font_lower font_es
legend:
$ ui:COIN
( ui:FRAME_BL
* ui:CURSOR
/ font:SLASH
< ui:FRAME_TL
= ui:FRAME_B
_ ui:FRAME_T
{ ui:FRAME_L
grid:
..........<_________
..........{*Cuaderno
..........{.Mochila.
..........{.Equipo..
..........{.Acampar.
..........{.Mapa....
..........{.Guardar.
..........{.Opciones
..........{.Salir...
..........{.........
..........{Leo......
..........{Nv.....12
..........{....32/38
..........{EN...9/13
..........{..Normal.
..........{$....1250
..........{Dia......
..........(=========
sprites:
; Leo (pixel-artist leo.tiles DOWN_A), 16x16 at the camera spot (64, 64)
leo:0 64 64
leo:1 64 72
leo:2 72 64
leo:3 72 72
; OAM 0 (HUD heart) moved to the panel PV row while it is open
uispr:2 88 96
uispr:3 88 104
; OAM 1 (HUD bowl) moved to the panel saciedad row
uispr:8 88 112
uispr:9 88 120
